ения.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white px-4 py-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold text-red mb-0.5\",\"children\":\"Губи\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Задължителни тестове за почтеност, чиито условия се определят с наредба, а не в закона.\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Гражданите\",{\"className\":\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold px-4 pt-3\",\"children\":[\"Гражданите\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs whitespace-nowrap\",\"children\":[\" \",[[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://www.parliament.bg/bg/bills/ID/167217\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noreferrer\",\"title\":\"Народно събрание: законопроект № 52-602-01-26 и доклад на правната комисия (28.07.2026)\",\"className\":\"ml-0.5 no-underline\",\"children\":[\"[\",1,\"]\"]}]]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-rule mt-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white px-4 py-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#2f7d57] mb-0.5\",\"children\":\"Печели\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"По-малък риск от корупция в администрацията, ако проверките работят.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white px-4 py-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold text-red mb-0.5\",\"children\":\"Губи\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"—\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold mb-1\",\"children\":\"Източници\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"list-decimal pl-5 space-y-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"https://www.parliament.bg/bg/bills/ID/167217\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.parliament.bg/bg/bills/ID/167217\",\"target\":\"_